WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700
Client sources become a BPMN process.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.200
Each activity is linked to the interview sentence behind it.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.800
The As-Is simulation shows requests queuing at «Approve spend»: the bottleneck.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.400
Repeated To-Be scenarios compare time and cost per request. Simulated values.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.600
The process goes to the client through a dashboard link.
